Cuiw
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
PETEF 0 FACE_LAST
PETEF 9 FACE_LAST
PETEF 9 FACE_LAST
PETEF 6 FACE_HALF
PETEF 9 FACE_HALF
PETEF 6 FACE_HALF
PETEF 4 FACE_HALF
PETEF 8 FACE_HALF
PETEF 1 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE PETEF PETEF
OR
    AND
        DEST Rank K
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        DEST Size > 2
MOVE_STACK PETEF PETEF
AND
    DESTSRC Rank add_13
    DEST Size >= 0
$win
PILE ALL PETEF Empty
